#: src/big_remote_play/ui/headscale_wizard.py:449
msgid ""
"Advanced. HTTPS certificates can be harder to configure with an IP address."
msgstr ""
"Для дасведчаных. З IP-адрасам сертыфікаты HTTPS бывае складаней наладзіць."

#: src/big_remote_play/ui/host_view.py:3451
msgid ""
"Advanced: IP addresses for manual connection when automatic discovery fails."
msgstr ""
"Дадаткова: IP-адрасы для ручнога падключэння, калі аўтаматычнае выяўленне не "
"спрацоўвае."

#: src/big_remote_play/ui/support_center.py:74
msgid ""
"After a wrong PIN, Moonlight shows a new one: start pairing again there and "
