"выключаны)"

#: src/big_remote_play/ui/preferences.py:219
msgid ""
"All your changes in Big Remote Play will be restored! This includes Sunshine "
"and Moonlight settings."
msgstr ""
"Усе вашы змены ў Big Remote Play будуць адноўлены! Гэта ўключае налады "
"Sunshine і Moonlight."

#: src/big_remote_play/host/health_checks.py:207
#: src/big_remote_play/ui/host_view.py:3541
#: src/big_remote_play/ui/network_common.py:181
#: src/big_remote_play/ui/network_common.py:205
